# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Identity5 / Unreal Engine 5.8  ——  只提交"源"，不提交"产物"
# 判断标准：换一台机器能否自动重新生成？能 → 忽略
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── 1. 编译产物（换机可重编，且与机器/引擎版本绑定）──
/Binaries/
/Build/
/Intermediate/
/DerivedDataCache/
/Saved/
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.sdf

# ── 2. IDE 与解决方案（UBT 会自动重新生成）──
/.vs/
/.vscode/
/.idea/
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.VC.opendb
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/
.vsconfig

# ── 3. 第三方/预编译插件的二进制（RiderLink 会随引擎重新编译）──
/Plugins/Developer/RiderLink/Binaries/
/Plugins/Developer/RiderLink/Intermediate/
/Plugins/GameFeatures/*/Binaries/
/Plugins/GameFeatures/*/Intermediate/

# ── 4. 编辑器临时/派生资产目录 ──
/Content/Collections/
/Content/Developers/
/Content/__ExternalActors__/
/Content/__ExternalObjects__/

# ── 5. C++ 中间文件碎片 ──
*.cpp.hash
*.tmp
*.temp
*.log
*.cache

# ── 6. 操作系统噪音 ──
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# ── 7. 大体积原始资产（如果你把美术源文件放进工程）──
# 建议把美术源文件（PSD/Blender 工程）放在工程外的资源库，
# 只有导出的 fbx/png 进工程。若确实要放进来，取消下面注释：
# /RawArt/